# Expense Tracker

A simple web-based Expense Tracker application built using Python, Flask, SQLite, HTML, and CSS.

## Features

- Add income and expense transactions
- View total income, total expenses, and balance
- Edit existing transactions
- Delete transactions
- Search transactions by category
- View an expense breakdown using a pie chart
- Export transactions to a CSV file

## Technologies Used

- Python
- Flask
- SQLite
- HTML5
- CSS3
- JavaScript
- Chart.js

